internal: two Packets created with seed 200 draw alike in 4 of 4, a $urandom and a $random before each draw change nothing in 4 of 4
external: p re-seeded with 300 draws as a Packet created with seed 300 in 4 of 4
new: a Packet randomized inside new() after srandom(200) holds the first draw of one created with 200: 1
